Package: TransactionAnomalyR
Type: Package
Title: Real-Time Credit Card Fraud Detection using Statistical and ML
        Methods
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-04-04
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Prashant",
    family = "Shekhar",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "prashantsh22@iitk.ac.in")
Description: Credit card fraud detection using the Kaggle Credit Card Fraud
    dataset. Implements PCA dimensionality reduction, EM Algorithm for mixture
    modelling, Logistic Regression via Gradient Descent, kNN anomaly scoring,
    Bootstrap threshold estimation, CLT-based confidence intervals, and
    k-fold Cross-Validation. Includes a full Shiny dashboard for interactive
    analysis. Designed for both research and real-time production use.
